<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97712" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-σπάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pull down with oneself</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἥρωα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nigr.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dragged down along with</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὴν ὁμοίαν διαβολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pisc.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.914e
			</span></i>; of the collar-bone, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.361
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ φρούρια τὰ εἰς τὴν Σύρων
				ἐπικράτειαν συγκατασπασθέντα</span>
			<i>which were at the same time brought</i> under their dominion,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.5.24
			</span></i> (v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>gulp down, swallow together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγκιστρον δελέατι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
